<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vivra raised, Invacare cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vivra raised, Invacare cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it changed its ratings on three healthcare companies.</p>
<p>-- Raised Vivra Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cut Apria Healthcare Group Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Cut Invacare Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Vivra shares rose 1-3/8 to 32, Apria fell 1-1/8 to 24-1/4 and Invacare fell 1-1/2 to 29-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
